  "question": {
    "text": "The electrode potential, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>°</mo></math> , for the reduction of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> to <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> in acidic medium is +1.51 V. Which of the following metal(s) will be oxidised? The reduction reactions and standard electrode potentials for <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> are given as<br />\r<br />\r<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>°</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>0.762</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math><br />\r<br />\r<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>⇌</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>°</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>0.80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math><br />\r<br />\r<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>⇌</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>°</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1.69</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>"
