  "solution": {
    "text": "More +ve the value of reduction potential more will be the tendency to undergo reduction.<br /><br />The <math> <mrow>  <msubsup>   <mtext>E</mtext>   <mrow>    <mtext>red</mtext></mrow>   <mtext>o</mtext>  </msubsup>  <mfenced>   <mrow>    <msubsup>     <mrow>      <mtext>MnO</mtext></mrow>     <mn>4</mn>     <mo>&#x2212;</mo>    </msubsup>    <mo>&#x007C;</mo><msup>     <mrow>      <mtext>Mn</mtext></mrow>     <mrow>      <mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow>    </msup>    </mrow>  </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1.51</mn><mtext>&#x2009;</mtext><mtext>V</mtext></mrow></math> value is greater than <math> <mrow>  <msubsup>   <mtext>E</mtext>   <mrow>    <mtext>red</mtext></mrow>   <mtext>o</mtext>  </msubsup>  <mfenced>   <mrow>    <msup>     <mrow>      <mtext>Zn</mtext></mrow>     <mrow>      <mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow>    </msup>    <mo>&#x007C;</mo><mtext>Zn</mtext></mrow>  </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#x2212;</mo><mn>0.762</mn><mtext>&#x2009;</mtext><mtext>V</mtext></mrow></math> and <math> <mrow>  <msubsup>   <mtext>E</mtext>   <mrow>    <mtext>red</mtext></mrow>   <mtext>o</mtext>  </msubsup>  <mfenced>   <mrow>    <msup>     <mrow>      <mtext>Ag</mtext></mrow>     <mo>+</mo>    </msup>    <mo>&#x007C;</mo><mtext>Ag</mtext></mrow>  </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>0.80</mn><mtext>&#x2009;</mtext><mtext>V</mtext></mrow></math>. Thus, only Zn and Ag will be oxidised."
